<title>UK: Depfa unit sets $200 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Depfa unit sets $200 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEPFA BANK EUROPE</p>
<p>KEEPWELL AGREEMENT FROM DEPFA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    14.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.175   PAY DATE    14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A1/=	LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE/IR  NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  1.225     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
